=================================================================================
EXCEL FORMULA SOLUTION - INPUT TO OUTPUT TRANSFORMATION
=================================================================================

ASSUMPTIONS:
- Input data starts in Row 2 (Row 1 has headers)
- Input columns: A=Level 5 ID, B=Level 5 Name, C=Level 4 ID, D=Level 4 Name, 
  E=Level 3 ID, F=Level 3 Name, G=Level 2 ID, H=Level 2 Name, I=Level 1 ID, J=Level 1 Name
- Output starts in Row 2
- Each input row generates 3 output rows

=================================================================================
OUTPUT COLUMN FORMULAS
=================================================================================

SETUP:
------
1. Create a helper column (let's say Column K) with row numbers: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6...
2. For each input row, you need 3 output rows


OUTPUT ROW CALCULATION:
-----------------------
Helper Column (K2): =INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2
This identifies which input row this output row corresponds to


COLUMN 1: Level 2 Name (Top C)
-------------------------------
Formula for Output Column 1 (e.g., L2):

=IF(INDIRECT("B"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)="","","SAS - "&INDIRECT("H"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)&" (L2)")

Result: "SAS - Auroma_1.0 (L2)"


COLUMN 2: Middle C (Status Based)
----------------------------------
Formula for Output Column 2 (e.g., M2):

=IF(INDIRECT("B"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)="","",IF(OR(ISNUMBER(SEARCH("(STD)",INDIRECT("B"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2))),ISNUMBER(SEARCH("(STANDARD)",INDIRECT("B"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)))),"SAS - ALL","SAS - ALT"))

Result: "SAS - ALL" if (STD) or (STANDARD) found, else "SAS - ALT"


COLUMN 3: Middle C (Code Row 1/2/3)
------------------------------------
Formula for Output Column 3 (e.g., N2):

=IF(INDIRECT("B"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)="","",IF(MOD(ROW()-2,3)=0,"SOS - GRCALL",IF(MOD(ROW()-2,3)=1,"SOS - RACALL","SOS - RACALL")))

Note: GRC/RAC are configurable defaults. Adjust as needed.

Alternative if you want different values for Row 2 and Row 3:
=IF(INDIRECT("B"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)="","",CHOOSE(MOD(ROW()-2,3)+1,"SOS - GRCALL","SOS - RACALL","SOS - RACALL"))


COLUMN 4: Lowest C (Mapped Code)
---------------------------------
Formula for Output Column 4 (e.g., O2):

=IF(INDIRECT("B"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)="","",IF(MOD(ROW()-2,3)=0,"",IF(MOD(ROW()-2,3)=1,"SOS - ARAC","SOS - SRAC")))

Result: Empty for Row 1, "SOS - ARAC" for Row 2, "SOS - SRAC" for Row 3


COLUMN 5: N element (Final Code Output)
----------------------------------------
Formula for Output Column 5 (e.g., P2):

=IF(INDIRECT("B"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)="","","SAS_"&INDIRECT("A"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)&"_"&CHOOSE(MOD(ROW()-2,3)+1,"NCR","ARAC","SRAC"))

Result: "SAS_XXX001_NCR", "SAS_XXX001_ARAC", "SAS_XXX001_SRAC"


=================================================================================
COMPLETE FORMULA SET (Copy-Paste Ready)
=================================================================================

Assuming:
- Input data in columns A-J starting Row 2
- Output in columns L-P starting Row 2
- Helper column K

HELPER COLUMN K2:
=INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2

OUTPUT L2 (Top C):
=IF(INDIRECT("B"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)="","","SAS - "&INDIRECT("H"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)&" (L2)")

OUTPUT M2 (Middle C - Status):
=IF(INDIRECT("B"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)="","",IF(OR(ISNUMBER(SEARCH("(STD)",INDIRECT("B"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2))),ISNUMBER(SEARCH("(STANDARD)",INDIRECT("B"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)))),"SAS - ALL","SAS - ALT"))

OUTPUT N2 (Middle C - Code):
=IF(INDIRECT("B"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)="","",CHOOSE(MOD(ROW()-2,3)+1,"SOS - GRCALL","SOS - RACALL","SOS - RACALL"))

OUTPUT O2 (Lowest C):
=IF(INDIRECT("B"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)="","",IF(MOD(ROW()-2,3)=0,"",IF(MOD(ROW()-2,3)=1,"SOS - ARAC","SOS - SRAC")))

OUTPUT P2 (N element):
=IF(INDIRECT("B"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)="","","SAS_"&INDIRECT("A"&INT((ROW()-2)/3)+2)&"_"&CHOOSE(MOD(ROW()-2,3)+1,"NCR","ARAC","SRAC"))


COPY THESE FORMULAS DOWN FOR ALL OUTPUT ROWS (3x the number of input rows)


=================================================================================
EXAMPLE RESULT FOR INPUT ROW: XXX001 | Auroma_1 (std)
=================================================================================

Output Row 1:
- Top C: SAS - Auroma_1.0 (L2)
- Middle C Status: SAS - ALL
- Middle C Code: SOS - GRCALL
- Lowest C: [empty]
- N element: SAS_XXX001_NCR

Output Row 2:
- Top C: SAS - Auroma_1.0 (L2)
- Middle C Status: SAS - ALL
- Middle C Code: SOS - RACALL
- Lowest C: SOS - ARAC
- N element: SAS_XXX001_ARAC

Output Row 3:
- Top C: SAS - Auroma_1.0 (L2)
- Middle C Status: SAS - ALL
- Middle C Code: SOS - RACALL
- Lowest C: SOS - SRAC
- N element: SAS_XXX001_SRAC


=================================================================================
NOTES:
=================================================================================
1. Adjust GRC/RAC values in Column 3 formula as needed for your configuration
2. All formulas use INDIRECT to reference input rows dynamically
3. MOD function determines which of the 3 output rows we're on (0, 1, or 2)
4. CHOOSE function selects appropriate code based on output row number
5. Formula assumes continuous data - adjust if rows have gaps